  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 oPt Emergency Appeal - West Bank - Emergency Health and Nutrition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To address the escalating needs, the Agency will enhance trauma care with emergency supplies, pre-position essentials in the northern West Bank, and install on-site lab equipment to counter restricted sample transport. A new storage facility in Nablus will aid medicine distribution, while four mobile teams and telemedicine will ensure continued care during incursions. Additionally, 80 new health workers will be deployed to ease workloads and fill gaps, and hospitalization support will be provided for 500 refugees. UNRWA will also maintain clinic operations through necessary repairs amid ongoing violence.</narrative>
  </description>
